Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.43,0:04:58.28,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}新種の使徒？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.82,0:05:00.50,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ＭＡＧＩは判断を保留しています
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.10,0:05:01.73,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}もう…
