Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:16.96,0:07:18.85,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}何だよ これ… おかしいよ！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:21.66,0:07:22.70,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君 逃げて！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.80,0:07:23.45,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.10,0:07:24.60,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}碇君！
