Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.93,0:07:40.62,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ミサトさん！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.12,0:07:42.27,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ミサトさーん！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:43.83,0:07:44.46,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.32,0:07:45.93,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}アスカ レイ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:46.10,0:07:47.65,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}初号機を救出 急いで！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.10,0:07:48.74,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}あのバカ！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.95,0:07:51.24,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}模試だけ満点 取ったって しょうがないじゃない！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.07,0:07:54.72,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}また消えた！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.93,0:07:55.90,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}アスカ 気をつけて！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:56.30,0:07:56.80,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}影？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.73,0:08:06.92,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}いやぁぁ！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:20.02,0:08:20.64,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}ハッ 街が…
