Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.58,0:09:25.34,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}プレッシャーかけてるつもりなのよ 私たちに
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.57,0:09:26.76,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}やれやれだわ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.28,0:09:29.13,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}独断専行 作戦無視
