Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:21.44,0:20:22.36,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:23.11,0:20:24.01,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:25.58,0:20:27.88,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}シンジ君 大丈夫？ シンジ君！
